  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\">與任何官方賽車系列無關。</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px\">需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>（推薦），或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> + <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>，以支援自訂模型與紋理。</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">若您想支持我們的工作，可在材質包內的「License」檔案中找到我們的 buycoffees 連結。</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Mercedes Safety Car</span><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">所有帶箱子的船（含竹子箱子筏）</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">oak_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Ferrari 1,2</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Sauber 7,8</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">spruce_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Minardi 22,23<br></span><br>（適用於 1.20-1.21.3 版本）<br><em><br>Toyota 24,25</em><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">birch_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Renault14,15</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">jungle_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Jaguar 16,17</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">acacia_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Mclaren 3,4</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">dark_oak_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">BAR Honda 11,12</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">cherry_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Jordan 9,10</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">mangrove_boat</span><br><br><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Williams 5,6<br></span><br><br><br><strong>bamboo_raft<br><br></strong><em>Arrows 20,21</em><strong><br><br><br><br></strong>（適用於 1.21.4 或更高版本）<br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">pale_oak_boat<br><em><br></em></span><em>Toyota 24,25</em></p>",
